    "chapter": 18,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你有没有看见我家的狗？\n\n本：李阿姨好！\n李阿姨：本，你有没有看见我家的狗—杰克？\n本：杰克不见了？\n李阿姨：是啊！我刚才和张阿姨说了几句话，没看着它，它就不见了。\n本：我帮你找一找吧！\n李阿姨：谢谢！\n本：不客气！",
    "traditional": "你有沒有看見我家的狗？\n\n本：李阿姨好！\n李阿姨：本，你有沒有看見我家的狗—傑克？\n本：傑克不見了？\n李阿姨：是啊！我剛才和張阿姨說了幾句話，沒看著它，它就不見了。\n本：我幫你找一找吧！\n李阿姨：謝謝！\n本：不客氣！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Have you seen our family dog?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：李阿姨好！",
      "traditional": "本：李阿姨好！",
      "pinyin": "běn lǐ ā yí hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello, Aunt Li!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "李阿姨：本，你有没有看见我家的狗—杰克？",
      "traditional": "李阿姨：本，你有沒有看見我家的狗—傑克？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ ā yí běn nǐ yǒu méi yǒu kàn jiàn wǒ jiā de gǒu jié kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Aunt Li: Ben, have you seen our family dog – Jack?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：杰克不见了？",
      "traditional": "本：傑克不見了？",
      "pinyin": "běn jié kè bú jiàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Jack is missing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "李阿姨：是啊！我刚才和张阿姨说了几句话，没看着它，它就不见了。",
      "traditional": "李阿姨：是啊！我剛才和張阿姨說了幾句話，沒看著它，它就不見了。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ ā yí shì a wǒ gāng cái hé zhāng ā yí shuō le jǐ jù huà méi kàn zhe tā tā jiù bú jiàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Aunt Li: Yes! I was exchanging a few words with Aunt Zhang and didn't watch him, and he just disappeared."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：我帮你找一找吧！",
      "traditional": "本：我幫你找一找吧！",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ bāng nǐ zhǎo yì zhǎo ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I'll help you look!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "李阿姨：谢谢！",
      "traditional": "李阿姨：謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "lǐ ā yí xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Aunt Li: Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：不客气！",
      "traditional": "本：不客氣！",
      "pinyin": "běn bú kè qi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: No problem!"
    }
  ],
